        <li>Real usage</li>
        <li>Liquidity depth</li>
        <li>Adoption over time</li>
        <li>Infrastructure growth</li>
        <li>Actual settlement activity</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Not hype. Not influencer predictions. Not fake certainty.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>How To Think About It</h2>
      <p>Treat XRPL like infrastructure.</p>
      <p>The more it is used, the more valuable the rail becomes. The less it is used, the less pressure exists to hold the asset that powers movement on that rail.</p>
      <p>That is the framework.</p>
